        "TileImage": "$($repository 2813381d-9cf6-42f8-8cc9-9d84b8c58d9c).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Bangkok\rGuests of the infamous Himmipan Hotel have been hearing strange noises echoing throughout the halls in the evening, others have been claiming that items from their room have been stolen while they were in their suite&apos;s.There is even reports of a horse roaming around the halls which is strange as there are no pets or animals permitted on the property.\r\rThing&apos;s sure are strange here 47, but hay im sure you&apos;ll get to the bottom of this.\rDon&apos;t forget to wash your lucky horseshoe.",
